In the updated python program (file name: TabletDistributionUpdated102126.py), same actions as in the "TabletDistributionFinal.py" are performed: Import csv data file obtained from ImageJ image processing and divides
the tablet into 16 equal radial sectors by default. The program produces an excel file that summazies particle count CV, particle area-sum CV (CVcoverage), mean particle area, mean particle diameter and standard deviatation of particle
diameter. Particle area and diameter distribution and Log-related statistics are also obtained but these are less relevant parameters and will not be used to assess distributional homogeneity. 
